.TH CERT_RECEIVE.PY "8" "July 2022" "cert_receive.py 0.2" "System Manager's Manual"
.SH NAME
cert_receive.py \- install an SSL/TLS certificate and key
.SH DESCRIPTION
usage: cert_receive.py [\-\-ca\-file FILE]
.IP
[\-\-ca\-path PATH | \-\-no\-ca\-path] [\-\-check\-config]
.IP
[\-\-config\-file FILE] [\-\-receive\-timeout TIMEOUT]
.IP
[\-\-set\-effective\-user USER | \-\-no\-set\-effective\-user]
.SS "optional arguments:"
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\-file\fR FILE
.HP
\fB\-\-ca\-path\fR PATH
.HP
\fB\-\-no\-ca\-path\fR
.HP
\fB\-\-check\-config\fR
.HP
\fB\-\-config\-file\fR FILE
.HP
\fB\-\-receive\-timeout\fR TIMEOUT
.HP
\fB\-\-set\-effective\-user\fR USER
.HP
\fB\-\-no\-set\-effective\-user\fR
